---
id: blueberry-peanut-butter-overnight-oats
title: Blueberry & Peanut Butter Overnight Oats
category: breakfast

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 370

storage:
  fridge_days: 2
  freezer_friendly: false

---

In a jar or bowl, combine @rolled-oats{1/3%cup} with @partly-skimmed-milk-2pct{1%cup} and @chia-seeds{1%tbsp}. Stir well, cover, and refrigerate overnight ~chill{8%hour}.

In the morning, warm in the #microwave for ~reheat{2%minute} until hot. Top with @crunchy-peanut-butter{1%tsp}, @frozen-blueberries{1/2%cup}, and @golden-raisins{1%tbsp}. Stir and serve.
